    "name": "Clockwork",
    "description": "The inside of a fine mechanical movement shot macro: brushed brass wheels with involute teeth and spoked hubs on a dark perlaged plate, Geneva-striped brass bridges with engraved lettering, blued screws, ruby jewels, a mainspring barrel, a balance wheel with a breathing hairspring and an anchor escapement that ticks the whole gear train forward in discrete steps; a cam drops a lever and a hammer strikes a bell. Captions on a small enamel plaque.",
